1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,973
How does a brand new word get into the dictionary?

2
00:00:02,973 --> 00:00:03,900
It follows a path.

3
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:06,520
First, someone uses it.

4
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:09,299
Then it spreads, in conversations and online.

5
00:00:09,299 --> 00:00:12,202
Dictionary editors collect real examples of it.

6
00:00:12,202 --> 00:00:15,166
And if enough people keep using it, it is added.

7
00:00:16,366 --> 00:00:18,552
So dictionaries do not invent words.

8
00:00:18,552 --> 00:00:19,160
People do.

9
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:20,678
Editors just record them.

10
00:00:20,678 --> 00:00:22,500
Which new word should be next?

